1
00:00:00,586 --> 00:00:02,756
(Howard:)But before I go...

2
00:00:03,631 --> 00:00:08,221
(Howard:)...would you mind if I just take one picture
of us together for my Facebook page?

3
00:00:08,386 --> 00:00:09,846
(Summer:)Sure.

4
00:00:18,813 --> 00:00:20,563
(Penny:)Okay. Great.

5
00:00:20,731 --> 00:00:23,191
(Howard:)Can I take one
where it looks like we're making out?

6
00:00:24,735 --> 00:00:31,445
(Sheldon:)Okay, now you're going to insert
the flash drive into the USB port.

7
00:00:31,617 --> 00:00:32,947
[EXHALES SHARPLY]

8
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:37,250
(Sheldon:)She calls me Moon Pie
because I'm nummy-nummy...

9
00:00:37,415 --> 00:00:40,045
(Sheldon:)...and she could just eat me up.

10
00:00:41,252 --> 00:00:45,802
(Sheldon:)Now please put the flash drive
in the USB port.

11
00:00:47,508 --> 00:00:50,348
(Sheldon:)The one that looks like
a little duck's mouth.

12
00:00:52,597 --> 00:00:55,727
- Hey, how'd it go?
- Terminator broke my phone.

13
00:01:01,772 --> 00:01:03,612
(Leonard:)Excuse me.

14
00:01:05,109 --> 00:01:06,489
(Leonard:)Okay, I'll be honest with you.

15
00:01:06,652 --> 00:01:09,942
I've spent the last two hours imagining
various scenarios in my head...

16
00:01:10,114 --> 00:01:12,614
...trying to come up with some line
to say to you...

17
00:01:12,783 --> 00:01:16,073
(Leonard:)...but then I finally realized
you're a human being, I'm a human being.

18
00:01:16,245 --> 00:01:17,285
(Leonard:)I could just say...

19
00:01:17,455 --> 00:01:18,455
CONDUCTOR [ON PA]:
Next stop, Santa Barbara.

20
00:01:18,623 --> 00:01:20,703
(Summer:)I'm sorry. This is me.

21
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:25,300
"Hi, my name's Leonard."

22
00:01:29,467 --> 00:01:32,927
(Sheldon:)So I'm thinking you won the Nobel Prize,
what, three years ago...

23
00:01:33,095 --> 00:01:36,515
(Sheldon:)...so you must deal with a whole lot
of "What has Smoot done lately?"

24
00:01:38,267 --> 00:01:41,647
(Sheldon:)My thought is we continue my research
as a team, you know...

25
00:01:41,812 --> 00:01:43,482
(Sheldon:)...Cooper-Smoot, alphabetical...

26
00:01:43,648 --> 00:01:47,818
(Sheldon:)...and when we win the Nobel Prize,
you'll be back on top.

27
00:01:48,444 --> 00:01:51,114
(George Smoot:)With all due respect, Dr. Cooper,
are you on crack?

28
00:01:55,201 --> 00:01:57,491
Fine. Smoot-Cooper.

29
00:01:57,662 --> 00:02:00,332
(Sheldon:)Wow, what a diva.

